 "annotations": [
  "agent summary: The model under-predicts gas flow by about 8% (bias_z 4.18, rmse_z 7.47 after the fit). The residual follows the thickened-WAS feed fraction and feed batch, not load, and refitting k_dis, k_hyd_li and k_m_ac does not remove it (call 17). COD closure is -0.059, the charge balance is inconsistent (call 3), and a TAN assay during the high-WAS batch disagrees with the model (z 2.66, call 18), while the gas-composition, pH and alkalinity channels fit within noise. So the feed catalogue under-states what the WAS delivers. Kinetics stay at defaults (the prediction is a simulation at defaults, call 21) and no kinetic update is offered; transients cannot be assessed because gas, CH4 and pH data go missing during high-load events (call 2).",
  "duration guard: 13.32 s per evaluation (measured; 76 evaluations measured so far)"
 ],
